      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0064",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：24：13：12"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0065",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 65,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0065",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：大概5月10号前后，突然来一个紧急命令，说炮兵团带着一营，跟我这个营的（一部），五个连，另外一个营到徐州去会战去了，没有在这里在32军参谋长统一指挥底下，到了菏泽，守菏泽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0066",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 66,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0066",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "记者：这个时候是土肥原的日军南下是吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0067",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 67,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0067",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：25：21：12"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0068",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 68,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0068",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：就是土肥原的一个师，日本的14师，是一个主力师吧，配备了有坦克、大炮、空中的飞机。那个炮队都有系留气球，系留气球在城上边悬起来，把城里边的情况看得清清楚楚的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0069",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 69,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0069",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：26：07：20"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0070",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 70,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0070",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：那个时候我们没有高射武器，也打不到它，所以到最后我们城也没守住。这个时候32军参谋长叫傅立平，他是陆军大学的战术教官，实际上是他指挥部队。那个时候32军的一个主力部队，就是一个主力旅吧，在外头归他指挥；另外他是代表20集团军守菏泽嘛。外面的几个部队通信联络也不行，部队也不大熟悉嘛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0071",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 71,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0071",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：27：13：16"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0072",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 72,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0072",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：土肥原那个部队是日本的一个主力师吧，精锐的一个师吧，很快地就打到城边去。就我们那个部队到了菏泽城里边，大概也就两天吧，敌人5月14号就到了菏泽。所以以后我们外边的部队抵抗不住退回来，敌人就在西北角上突破了城墙，把城墙炸倒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0073",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 73,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0073",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：28：17：15"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0074",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 74,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0074",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：接着就攻打城里边，发生了巷战。我们这个炮兵部队打敌人封锁这个城市豁口，也就剩了几发炮弹，打这个巷战配合了一下子，炮弹也打光了。以后上边示意赶快爬城墙突围吧。为什么要爬城墙呢？四个城门都堵上了，都出不去了，上边虽然不明说，就是（暗示）各自突围吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0075",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 75,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0075",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：29：26：13"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0076",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 76,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0076",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：那个时候我们也想把这个炮炸毁，但是也没有可炸的炸药，手榴弹都没有，所以就把炮也丢在那个地方。一个炮兵想了好久没有得到的炮，得到了以后一年多的时间，射击也没有射击过，步炮协同训练也没有搞过，就上来打仗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0077",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 77,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0077",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：30：12：23"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0078",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 78,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0078",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：（炮兵）对武器非常地爱护，非常地（珍惜）！丢掉了，那自己真是感觉着心痛啊！另外自己也太觉着耻辱啊，为什么让它（被弃）？当时是参谋长的命令把四个城门都堵上了，你退也退不了啊！当时自己的心情就这么个心情。好在这个炮是阎锡山的太原兵工厂出的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0079",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 79,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0079",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：31：03：18"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0080",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 80,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0080",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "陈锐霆：这个时候太原兵工厂早已被日本人攻占了，炮弹也没有了。不久，我不是还有一个连嘛，回来后上边有命令，把这个炮都收缴上去了。接着当天晚上参谋长召集了这么一两百人的（会议），（准备）袭击敌人的一个司令部吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC02-S0081",
      "document_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC02",
      "segment_order": 81,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.陈锐霆 090423（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0081",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "00：32：00：00"
    }
  ]
}
